#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:7
msgid ""
"Customers building their own custom mobile apps must host their own push "
"proxy service using one of the following methods:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:9
msgid ""
"Compile your own MPNS from the `open source repository "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-push-proxy>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:10
msgid ""
"Use the `pre-compiled version of MPNS available on GitHub "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-push-proxy/releases>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:12
msgid ""
"See our `developer documentation "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/mobile/push-"
"notifications/service/>`__ on working with the Mattermost Push "
"Notification Service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:15
msgid "Enable MPNS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:17
msgid "Go to **System Console > Environment > Push Notification Server**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:18
msgid ""
"Under **Enable Push Notifications**, select **Manually enter Push "
"Notification Service location**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:19
msgid ""
"Enter the location of your MPNS in the **Push Notification Server** "
"field, then select **Save**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:21
msgid "**Deployment recommendations:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:23
msgid ""
"Deploy the MPNS on your own infrastructure - whether on-premises behind "
"your firewall or in your public cloud."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:24
msgid ""
"Ensure the Mattermost server has network access to the MPNS instance. "
"Mattermost clients don't need any inbound connectivity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:25
msgid ""
"The MPNS does not connect with Mattermost mobile apps directly; the MPNS "
"parses and forwards push notifications from the Mattermost server to the "
"Apple Push Notification Service (APNS) or the Firebase Cloud Messaging "
"(FCM)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:26
msgid ""
"The MPNS must be able to communicate with the Apple Push Notification "
"Service over HTTP/2. If an outbound proxy appliance is deployed between "
"the MPNS and APNS, ensure it supports HTTP/2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:27
msgid "Configure TLS encryption between your MPNS and your Mattermost server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:28
msgid ""
"Sign the mobile applications during your build process, and obtain and "
"configure valid push certificates for both Android and iOS. Without these"
" certificates, the apps will be unable to send or receive notifications "
"via your MPNS instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:29
msgid ""
"Subscribe to `Mattermost Security Bulletins <https://mattermost.com"
"/security-updates/#sign-up>`__ to receive and promptly apply MPNS-related"
" security updates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:32
msgid "Configure ID-only push notification contents (Enterprise)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:33
msgid ""
"By default, push notification message content passes through Apple Push "
"Notification Service (APNS) or Google Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) "
"before it reaches a device. This potentially presents a problem for "
"organizations with ultra-strict security and compliance requirements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:35
msgid ""
"With the ID-only option, message contents can be fetched directly from "
"the server once a push notification is delivered to a device. APNS and "
"FCM can’t read push notifications since only a unique message ID is sent "
"in each notification payload. While message content will take slightly "
"longer to send, this feature helps organizations meet advanced compliance"
" requirements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:37
msgid "To set mobile push notification contents to ID-only:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:39
msgid "Go to **System Console > Site Configuration > Notifications**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:40
msgid ""
"Under **Push Notification Contents**, select **Full message content "
"fetched from the server on receipt**, then select **Save**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:44
msgid ""
"As part of the process of building the applications, you'll need to sign "
"the applications. You must also obtain the appropriate certificate for "
"both Android and iOS. If this isn't done, the applications won't be able "
"to interact with your instance of the MPNS. Once this is complete, you "
"can proceed with the deployment of your MPNS instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-service.rst:45
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend that you subscribe to `Mattermost Security "
"Bulletins <https://mattermost.com/security-updates/#sign-up>`__. When "
"you're notified of security updates for the MPNS, apply them promptly."
msgstr ""

